      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm using VectorInt for bitwise operation, therefore I can't just switch int Vector for float Vector.\nThis also doesn't work in U#. But you can change value after construction, so I think I will use that as a workaround for now",
      "viewerReactions": null,
